Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Figure 3.2.  Empirical distribution of q\[CenterDot]k \
for three values of d_k.  Without scaling (left), the spread grows like \
\[Sqrt](d_k).  After dividing by \[Sqrt](d_k) (right), all three \
distributions collapse onto a unit-variance shape.",
 FontSize->11,
