  PlotRange->{{0, 720.}, {0, 704.88}}]], "Output",
 CellMargins->{{Inherited, Inherited}, {5, 10}},
 TextAlignment->Center,
 CellLabel->"",ExpressionUUID->"bf9f097c-b754-4d6a-a0be-b15d09bd3e3a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Figure 6.2.",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "  Same 20-token probability row, three top-k cutoffs vs three ",
 "top-p cutoffs.  Notice that top-p with ",
 Cell[BoxData["p"], "Text",
  FontSize->14,ExpressionUUID->"d8eba161-5765-4aa6-8dd1-9390978b1ae6"],
 " = 0.95 ",
 "automatically expands the kept set when the head is flat and ",
 "contracts it when the head is sharp \[LongDash] something a fixed ",
 Cell[BoxData["k"], "Text",
  FontSize->14,ExpressionUUID->"8b172b82-ebc3-4407-80fc-1edf5c44a4e3"],
 " can't do."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f8d2782f-19bd-4067-acfb-2ba0caf6ed04"],

Cell["6.3  Beam search", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2b9574bf-ecf0-436d-b5da-c2f0b697cc98"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For translation-style tasks where one answer is correct, beam ",
 "search is the deterministic alternative.  Track ",
 StyleBox["beamWidth",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 " most likely partial sequences at every step; at the end return ",
 "the highest-scoring complete one.  Rare in generative LLMs but ",
 "still common in machine translation."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"83ebec07-69ad-4910-b4b7-919a39236bf0"],

Cell["6.4  Speculative decoding", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0eeb46f3-3b87-4e93-874c-14e8bd54cff6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A small draft model proposes ",
 Cell[BoxData["k"], "Text",
  FontSize->14,ExpressionUUID->"88f9e8b5-8f89-4ab2-869d-c3560819c5a3"],
 " tokens autoregressively; the main model verifies them in a single ",
 "forward pass; accepted tokens commit, the first rejected token is ",
 "resampled.  Useful when the draft is much cheaper than the main."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"19d0a1d9-a8cc-4efb-ba30-8b6d3e7773c8"],

