Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Figure 7.1.  Supervised fine-tuning a pretrained \
model on a small chat-formatted dataset.  Same loss, same optimiser; \
different data.",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic]], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1fd84d76-122c-43f3-8368-\
9502e6a090b9"],

Cell["7.1  Path A vs Path B", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0f057280-87eb-47b6-8d27-d0e865f3ab8f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Two routes meet here.  ",
 StyleBox["Path A: ",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "the canonical move.  Take OpenAI's pretrained GPT-2 small (124M ",
 "parameters), prepend it with our chat template, train for a few ",
 "rounds on a small Q&A dataset.  The result is a model that ",
 "actually speaks English.  ",
 StyleBox["Path B: ",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "the from-scratch demonstration.  Take the 1.8M model we trained ",
 "in Section 5, extend its vocabulary with three special tokens, ",
 "train.  The result is a model that, given enough scale, could ",
 "speak English; at this scale it produces locally plausible ",
 "Shakespeare-flavoured exchanges only."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c9544b98-ec0c-4c3e-9b6a-f0fd7c8c1faf"],

Cell["\<\
We will execute Path A here.  The Path B mechanics are identical; only the \
starting checkpoint changes.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bac44715-f14d-44ca-837e-02a3b514e17d"],

Cell["7.2  Path A: SFT-ing pretrained GPT-2 in 60 seconds", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b21cd945-3d5a-4efd-8546-9908f4873fc0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The toy instruction dataset ships in ",
 StyleBox["SFT.wl",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 ": 20 hand-written {user, assistant} pairs of Shakespeare-themed ",
 "Q&A.  Just enough to demonstrate SFT end-to-end.  The same code ",
 "consumes SmolTalk-sized datasets when scaled up."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a4f26aed-c07d-4d99-b52a-eb286eb31b64"],

Cell["LLMAtoZ`SFT`toyInstructionDataset[][[1 ;; 4]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"911f843c-7f52-4adb-b556-c8734b6f0dc2"],

